Package: flatratemath
Type: Package
Title: Benchmark Math for Flat-Rate Software Subscriptions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("James", "Verlander", email = "scrapertweeter3+cran@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: James Verlander <scrapertweeter3+cran@gmail.com>
Description: Two constants and two functions that benchmark a flat-rate
    unlimited software development subscription against the fully loaded
    monthly cost of a senior US software engineer. 'annual_saving()'
    returns the yearly dollar gap between the two rates and
    'coverage_multiple()' returns how many months of subscription work a
    single month of hiring budget covers. Pure arithmetic, no
    dependencies, suitable for pricing pages and procurement math.
